  "proposal_decisions": [
    "Natural Rust module is sole public business structure authority; generator owns ABI shim, no author FFI/IDL duplication",
    "Explicit bounded syn plus rustc witness chain; existing cbindgen and Clang validate generated physical ABI",
    "1–16 field i32/u32/String records; sync R or Result<R,E>, fieldless explicit positive i32 enum errors",
